---
source: tests/cli_help.rs
expression: help_output(args)
---
Sign in to Microsoft, check the sign-in, or sign out

Usage: ms-todo auth [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  login   Sign in with a device code: open the printed URL and enter the code
  status  Show the signed-in account, token expiry, client ID and scopes
  logout  Delete the stored sign-in
  bearer  Print a valid access token for Microsoft Graph, e.g. for curl. With --format table, prints only the token
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format: jsonl is one object per line, ids one ID per line [default: table in a terminal, json when piped] [possible values: table, json, jsonl, ids]
      --instance <NAME>  Use a separate copy of ms-todo's data (also MS_TODO_INSTANCE). Builds run from Cargo's target/ directory default to "dev"; "default" is the installed copy
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
